{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cup Shot Master</strong> is a tap-to-shoot arcade game that challenges your precision and timing. Your goal is simple: shoot the ball into moving cups. But with each level, the motion becomes less predictable and the pressure builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to changing cup speeds and patterns, and shoot at the perfect moment to stay in the game. Designed for short bursts or long sessions, this is pure tap-and-go fun with a clean, polished look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf One-touch controls<br>\ud83e\udd64 Reactive physics-based gameplay<br>\u2699\ufe0f Increasing difficulty per round<br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Perfect for casual sessions or arcade fans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep your aim sharp as the cups keep moving?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789220?t=1750446365","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789220?t=1750446365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789220/424b0080b8f44969b0a5af138f5b647f90833e25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750446365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789220/424b0080b8f44969b0a5af138f5b647f90833e25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750446365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cup Shot Master</strong> is a tap-to-shoot arcade game that challenges your precision and timing. Your goal is simple: shoot the ball into moving cups. But with each level, the motion becomes less predictable and the pressure builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to changing cup speeds and patterns, and shoot at the perfect moment to stay in the game. Designed for short bursts or long sessions, this is pure tap-and-go 